cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this calculator or model, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CRO-BSI GBDT risk calculator"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based calculator for the seven-variable gradient boosting (GBDT) model that estimates the risk of
  carbapenem-resistant organism bloodstream infection (CRO-BSI) in patients with hematological malignancies.
  Accompanies the manuscript "Interpretable machine learning model for risk stratification of CRO-BSI and
  triaging rapid mNGS in hematological malignancies: a multicenter study". The model was refitted from the
  original development cohort after the original server was decommissioned. Research use only; not a medical device.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
license: MIT
url: "https://cro-bsi.github.io/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cro-bsi/cro-bsi.github.io"
keywords:
  - CRO-BSI
  - hematological malignancies
  - machine learning
  - gradient boosting
  - risk calculator
